                            "playtime_at_review": 2240,
                            "last_played": 1793972175
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Likable characters, I'm not that far in so can't say much about the story, but learning how their paths cross with each mission is interesting enough to keep you playing. If you are a fan of turn based tactictal, but are annoyed by the unforgiveness and time strictness of xcom and the like this game is a must.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1791998757,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1791998757,
                        "voted_up": true,
                        "votes_up": 7,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.5197255611419678,
                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "\"If you are a fan of turn based tactictal, but are annoyed by the unforgiveness and time strictness of xcom and the like this game is a must.\"\n\nI really love this sentence, because we wanted *Troubleshooter* to serve as an alternative in this regard. I’m glad to see that our aspirations were headed in the right direction. Now, I believe it’s time to ensure that *Troubleshooter* develops a more distinct identity of its own.\n\nThank you for this review.",
